  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:450px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Assimilative Infection</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/92/The_Thing_Deformed.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190114182343\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Thing Deformed\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/92/The_Thing_Deformed.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190114182343\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/92/The_Thing_Deformed.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190114182343 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/92/The_Thing_Deformed.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190114182343 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Thing Deformed\" width=\"270\" height=\"113\" data-image-key=\"The_Thing_Deformed.jpg\" data-image-name=\"The Thing Deformed.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Thing (John Carpenter's The Thing) is an excellent example of a user with this power, as it assimilates other organisms through cellular infection. Only one single cell is needed to assimilate an entire organism.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Assimilate through infection.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>assimilate through infection</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Infection\" title=\"Infection\">Infection</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Conversion\" title=\"Conversion\">Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Assimilation Via Infection</li>\n<li>Infective Assimilation</li>\n<li>Infected Assimilator</li>\n<li>Parasitic Immortality</li>\n<li>Viral Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can assimilate others by infecting them, be it genetic, magical, etc. Like with normal absorption, users of this power can utilize this as a way to survive. However, they can also use the infected as their power source or even as a new capsule body to achieve <a href=\"/wiki/Immortality\" title=\"Immortality\">immortality</a> by turning the infected into the user or <a href=\"/wiki/Consciousness_Transferal\" title=\"Consciousness Transferal\">transferring their consciousness</a>, if needed. Body can also be fused to the main body if the user is capable of doing so.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infestation\" title=\"Infestation\">Infestation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Infection\" title=\"Infection\">Infection</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Replication\" title=\"Assimilative Replication\">Assimilative Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Manipulation\" title=\"Body Manipulation\">Body Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Disease_Manipulation\" title=\"Disease Manipulation\">Disease Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Immortality\" title=\"Immortality\">Immortality</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Retroactive_Immortality\" title=\"Retroactive Immortality\">Retroactive Immortality</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Absorbing Replication\">Evolving Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Replication\" title=\"Adaptive Replication\">Adaptive Replication</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superorganism_Physiology\" title=\"Superorganism Physiology\">Superorganism Physiology</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Superorganism_Manipulation\" title=\"Superorganism Manipulation\">Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Consciousness_Transferal\" title=\"Consciousness Transferal\">Consciousness Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Consciousness\" title=\"Mass Consciousness\">Mass Consciousness</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Hive_Mind\" title=\"Hive Mind\">Hive Mind</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Viral_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Viral Immunity\">Viral</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>The process may take time.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilative_Infection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Thing (<i>John Carpenter's The Thing</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gearsofwar.fandom.com/wiki/Lambent\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:gearsofwar:Lambent\">Lambent</a> (<i>Gears of War series</i>); via <a href=\"https://gearsofwar.fandom.com/wiki/Imulsion\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:gearsofwar:Imulsion\">Imulsion</a></li>\n<li>SCP-610 The Flesh That Hates (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Flood (<i>Halo Franchises</i>)</li>\n<li>The Long One (<i>Slither</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpower